<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">- Dawuro Full Bible Latin Version</book>
  <para style="h">Yaak'ooba Kiitaa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yaak'oobi S'aafeedda Kiitaa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yaak'ooba Kiitaa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yak'.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yaak'oobi</para>
  <para style="mt2">S'aafeedda Kiitaa</para>
  <para style="imt">Geluwaa</para>
  <para style="ip">Ha kiitaa s'aafeedda Yaak'oobi Godaa Yesuusa ishaappe attin tammanne laa"u Yesuusa kaalliyaawanttuppe ittuwaa gidenna. Ikka Yerusaalamen de'iyaa ammaniyaa asaa kaaletsiyaa c'imaa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 2:9">Gal. 2:9</ref></char>). Ha kiitay s'aafetteeddawe itti woosa gollattiw gidennaan Roome kawutetsaa giddon laaletteedda Ayihuda ammaniyaawanttu ubbatuwaassa gideedda, nuunakka hachche hachche de'uwaa kaaletsiyaa k'ofatuwaa oyk'k'eedda. S'aafetteeddawekka «Alamiyaa ubbaan laaletteedda S'oossaa asaassa». Ha mas'aafaa s'aafeeddawe aad'd'eedda eratetsaa nuuni oosuwaan peeshshiyaa hiillaanne ammaniyaa asaa eeshshaanne hanotaa tamaarissiyaa ogiyaa kaalesuwaa immiyaa yewatuwaa misiliyaadan k'onc'c'iyaan bessee.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hiyyeesatetsaabaa, duretetsaabaa, paac'c'iyaabaa, lo"o eeshshaabaa, k'anaatiyaabaa, ammanuwaabaanne lo"o oosuwaabaa, ins's'arssaa maaduwaabaanne k'ohuwaabaa, aad'd'eedda eratetsaabaa, ittuu ittuwaanna walak'ettiyaabaa, otoruwaabaanne ashikketetsaabaa, hara asaa bolla pirddiyaawaa, c'eek'uwaabaa woy ayyuwaabaa, genc'c'aabaanne woosaabaa, ammaniyaa Asay de'anaw bessiyaa ogiyaa ubbaa s'aafeedda.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kiitaykka kiristtinnaa de'uwaan ammanuu oosuwaan peeshshana hanotaabaa k'onc'c'issiide bessee.</para>
  <para style="iot">Shemppatuwaa Ubbatoo Imetteedda K'antsa K'ofatuwaa</para>
  <para style="io1">Geluwaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="JAS 1:1">1:1</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ammanuwaanne aad'd'eedda eratetsaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="JAS 1:2-8">1:2-8</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Hiyyeesatetsaabaanne duretetsaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="JAS 1:9-11">1:9-11</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Paac'iyaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="JAS 1:12-18">1:12-18</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">S'oossaa k'aalaa sisussaanne oosuwaa bolla peeshussaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="JAS 1:19-27">1:19-27</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Hanenna ogiyaan ittuu haraw maaddenna mala imetteedda oduwaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="JAS 2:1-13">2:1-13</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ammanuwaanne oosuwaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="JAS 2:14-26">2:14-26</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ammaniyaa asaanne ins's'arssaappe kesiyaa haasayaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="JAS 3:1-18">3:1-18</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ammaniyaa asaanne ha alamiyaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="JAS 4:1-5:6">4:1—5:6</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Dumma dumma yewoo imetteedda mak'k'uwaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="JAS 5:7-20">5:7-20</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JAS 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 1:1"/>Taani Yaak'oobi S'oossaa ayiliinne Godaa Yesuusi Kiristtoosa ayilii, biittaa ubbaan laaletteedda tammanne laa"u zeretsatoo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Biittaa ubbaan laaletteedda tammanne laa"u zeretsatoo: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yaak'oobi giidde de'iyaa k'ofay, Godaa kaalliyaa ammaniyaawantta gidiide tammanne laa"u Israa'eeliyaa zeretsatuwaadan barenttu morkkatuwaan biittaa ubbaa laaletti gakkeeddawantta guussaa.</char></note> sarotaa kiittay.<verse eid="JAS 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Danddayaa, Ammanuwaa, Aad'd'eedda Eratetsaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="JAS 1:2-3"/>Taanaadan S'oossaa kaalliyaawanttoo, hintte ammanuu paac'ettiyaawe hinttenttoo danddayaa immanawaa eriide, dumma dumma paac'ii hinttena gakkiyaa wode, hewaa kumentsaa nashechchaadan paydite. <verse eid="JAS 1:2-3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 1:4"/>Hintte danddayay ayinne bali baynnaan hinttena minneeddawanttanne pac'i bayinnawantta ootsiide, bare oosuwaa polo. <verse eid="JAS 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 1:5"/>Shin hintteppe ooninne barew aad'd'eedda eratetsay d'ayooppe, kad'ennaan ubbaw keekatetsan immiyaa S'oossaa woosso. I aw immana. <verse eid="JAS 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 1:6"/>Shin I ayaaninne sid'ennaan ammanuwaan S'oossaa woosso. Ayaw gooppe, sid'iyaa uray c'arkkuu sugina k'aas's'iyaa abbaa beetaa mala. <verse eid="JAS 1:6"/><verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="JAS 1:7-8"/>Ayaw gooppe, laa"u k'ofay de'iyaa uray, bare ogiyaa ubbaan bare k'ofaa k'achchennawe, he uray Godaappe ayinne demmanaw k'oppoppo.<verse eid="JAS 1:7-8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hiyyeesaa Asaanne Dure Asaa Nashechchaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 1:9"/>Shin hiyyeesaa ishay S'oossay Aa d'ok'k'u ootseedda wode nashetto. <verse eid="JAS 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 1:10"/>K'ay dure ishaykka S'oossay Aa kawushisseedda wode nashetto. Ayaw gooppe, dure bitanii maataa giddon dic'c'iyaa c'iishshaadan d'ayana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:6-7">Isa. 40:6-7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JAS 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 1:11"/>Ayaw gooppe, away bare seelaanna kesiide, maataa melissina, c'iishshay d'ayee; k'ay Aa malaa lo"otetsaykka d'ayee; hewaadankka k'ay dure bitanii barewaa ootsiidde d'ayana.<verse eid="JAS 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Asaa Bolla Gakkiyaa Paac'iyaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 1:12"/>Waayiyaan genc'c'iyaa uray anjjetteeddawaa; ayaw gooppe, he waayiyaa s'ooneeddawaappe guyyiyaan, S'oossay barena siik'iyaawanttoo immana geedda de'uwaa kalachchaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">De'uwaa kalachchaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bonchchetteedda de'uwaa guussaa.</char></note> I akkana. <verse eid="JAS 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 1:13"/>Ooninne paac'etteedda wode, «Taana S'oossay paac'c'ee» gooppo. Ayaw gooppe, S'oossay iitan paac'ettanaw danddayenna; k'ay I bare huup'ew oonanne paac'c'enna. <verse eid="JAS 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 1:14"/>Shin Asay huup'iyaan huup'iyaan bare huup'e iita amuwaan gooshettiyaa wodenne c'imettiyaa wode paac'ettee. <verse eid="JAS 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 1:15"/>Hewaappe guyyiyaan, amuu shahaariide, nagaraa yelee; k'ay nagaray dic'c'iide, hayk'uwaa yelee.<verse eid="JAS 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 1:16"/>Taanaadan S'oossaa kaalliyaawanttoo, c'imettoppite. <verse eid="JAS 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 1:17"/>Lo"o imuwaa ubbaynne kumentsaa woytaa ubbay saluwaappe yee. Saluwaa poo'uwaa med'd'eedda Aawuwaappe yee; S'oossay bare huup'ew dummatennanne woy bare kuwaa laammenna. <verse eid="JAS 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 1:18"/>Nuuni I med'd'eedda med'etatuwaa giddon d'ok'k'asaa akkanaadan, nuuna bare sheniyaan tumu k'aalaan yeleedda.<verse eid="JAS 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Siseeddawaa Oosuwaan Peeshshiyaawaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 1:19"/>Taanaadan S'oossaa kaalliyaawanttoo, hawaa hassayite; Asay ubbay sisanaw elleello; shin haasayanawunne hank'k'ettanaw elleelloppo. <verse eid="JAS 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 1:20"/>Ayaw gooppe, asaa hank'k'uu S'oossay koyyiyaa s'illotetsaa ahenna. <verse eid="JAS 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 1:21"/>Hewaa diraw, tuna hanotaa ubbaanne iitatetsaa ubbaa hintteppe d'ayissiide, S'oossay hintte wozanaan tookkeedda hintte shemppuwaa ashshanaw danddayiyaa k'aalaa ashikketetsan akkite.<verse eid="JAS 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 1:22"/>Shin S'oossaa k'aalaa oosuwaan peeshshiteppe attin, sisa s'alalaan hintte huup'iyaa c'immoppite. <verse eid="JAS 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 1:23"/>Ayaw gooppe, k'aalaa sisiide ootsenna uray de'ooppe, I bare malaa masttootiyaa s'eelliyaa uraa mala. <verse eid="JAS 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 1:24"/>I barena s'eelliide bee; ellekka I ay malenttonne dogi aggee. <verse eid="JAS 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 1:25"/>Shin ooninne ayiletetsaappe kessiyaa bali bayinna higgiyaa s'eelliide, aan ak'iyaawe k'ay Aa naagiyaawe, siseeddawaakka dogennawe, he uray bare ootsiyaa oosuwaan anjjettana.<verse eid="JAS 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 1:26"/>Bare ins's'arssaa naagennan barena c'immiidde, barew S'oossaa goyinniyaawaa malatiyaa uray de'ooppe, Aa goynay mela. <verse eid="JAS 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JAS 1:27"/>S'oossaa Aawuwaa sintsan pokkuu bayinna geeshsha goynay hawaa; hewe hak'awe gooppe, aata aawuu bayinna naanatuwaanne waayettiyaa am"etuwaa maaddanawaanne sa'aa nagaraa k'itaappe bare huup'iyaa naaganawaa.<verse eid="JAS 1:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JAS 2"/>
  <para style="s">Hiyyeesaa Kad'anaw Bessena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 2:1"/>Taanaadan S'oossaa kaalliyaawanttoo, hintte nu bonchcho Godaa Yesuusi Kiristtoosa ammani de'iidde, deemuwaa s'eelliide, asaa bonchchoppite. <verse eid="JAS 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 2:2"/>Ayaw gooppe, work'k'aa migiduwaa wotsiide, lo"o mayuwaa mayyeedda itti Asay hintte shiik'uwaa yooppe, k'ay c'urk'k'a mayuwaa mayyeedda hiyyeesaa asikka yooppe, <verse eid="JAS 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 2:3"/>lo"o mayuwaa mayyeedda bitaniyaa hintte aatsi bonchchiidde Aa, «Neeni hawaan ubbaappe lo"iyaa oydiyaan utta» giide k'ay hiyyeesaa bitaniyaa, «Neeni hininna ek'k'ashsha; woy hawaan ta gediyaa matan sa'aan utta» gooppe, <verse eid="JAS 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 2:4"/>yaatina hintte hintte giddon shaakotetsaa med'd'iyaawanttanne iita k'ofaanna de'iyaa daannatuwaa gidikkiteeyee?<verse eid="JAS 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 2:5"/>Taanaadan S'oossaa kaalliyaawanttoo, sisite; S'oossay ha sa'aan de'iyaa hiyyeesaa Asay ammanuwaan durettanawunne barena siik'iyaawanttoo immana geedda saluwaa kawutetsaa laattanaw dooribeenneyee? <verse eid="JAS 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 2:6"/>Shin hintte hiyyeesatuwaa toochcheeddita. Duretuu hinttena tuggayiyaawantta gidikkinooyee? Unttunttu hinttena daannan mootiyaawantta gidikkinooyee? <verse eid="JAS 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 2:7"/>Hinttew imetteedda lo"o suntsaa boriyaawanttu unttuntta gidikkinooyee?<verse eid="JAS 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 2:8"/>Shin S'oossaa Mas'aafan, «Ne shooruwaa ne huup'iyaadan siik'a» geetettiide s'aafetteedda kaatiyaa higgiyaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Kaatiyaa higgiyaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ubbaappe aad'uwaan go"iyaa higgiyaa; hawaa biletsay, kaatiyaappe imetteeddawaa guussaa. Kaatii oonee gooppe S'oossaappe imetteedda higgiyaa.</char></note> hintte polooppe, lo"obaa ootsiita.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Wog. 19:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JAS 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 2:9"/>Shin hintte asaa deemuwaa s'eelliide bonchchooppe, nagaraa ootsiita; k'ay higgii hintte bolla, higgiyaa mentseeddawanttudan pirddana. <verse eid="JAS 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 2:10"/>Ayaw gooppe, ooninne higgiyaa ubbaa naagiide, ittinno mentsiyaawaa gidooppe, he uray higgiyaa ubbaa mentsee. <verse eid="JAS 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 2:11"/>Ayaw gooppe, «Woshummoppa» geeddawe k'ay «Wod'oppa» geedda; shin neeni woshummana d'ayooppekka, wod'eeddawaa gidooppe, higgiyaa mentsaadda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:13">Kes. 20:13</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 20:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17">Zar. 5:17</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 5:18">18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JAS 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 2:12"/>Asaa ayiletetsaappe kessiyaa higgiyan, pirddaa akkana asatuwaadan haasayitenne unttunttuwaadan ootsite. <verse eid="JAS 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 2:13"/>Ayaw gooppe, asaa maaribeenna uraa S'oossay maarennan pirddana; maarotetsay pirddaa s'oonee.<verse eid="JAS 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ammanuwaanne Oosuwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 2:14"/>Taanaadan S'oossaa kaalliyaawanttoo, itti uray barew ammanuu de'ee gooppe, k'ay Aa ammanuwaa Aa oosuu erissana d'ayooppe, Aa ay go"anee? Aa ammanuu Aa ashshanaw danddayii? <verse eid="JAS 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 2:15"/>Itti ishay, woy itti michchata kallottooppe, k'ay unttunttoo ubbaa gallassi miyaabay d'ayooppe, <verse eid="JAS 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 2:16"/>hintteppe itti uray unttuntta, «Saro biite. Tamaa ho"ite. Kalliide miite» giide, unttunttoo koshshiyaawaa immana d'ayooppe, unttuntta ay go"anee? <verse eid="JAS 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 2:17"/>Hewaa diraw, ammanuu oosuu baynnaan barekka de'ooppe hayk'k'eeddawaa.<verse eid="JAS 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 2:18"/>Shin itti uray, «New ammanuu de'ee; k'ay taw oosuu de'ee. Neeni ne ammanuwaa ne oosuwaappe shaakkaade taana bessa; taanikka ta ammanuwaa ta oosuwaan neena bessana» gaana. <verse eid="JAS 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 2:19"/>Neeni itti S'oossay de'iyaawaa ammanaasa; hewe lo"a. S'alahetuukka k'ay ammaniino; yashshaan kokkoriino. <verse eid="JAS 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 2:20"/>Neeni eeyay! Ammanuu oosuwaappe shaakettiide go"ennawaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:20 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Go"ennawaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hawaa guussay hayk'k'eeddawaa guussaa.</char></note> eranaw koyyay? <verse eid="JAS 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 2:21"/>Nu aabbu Abraahaamo bare na'aa Yisaak'a yarshshiyaa sa'aa bolla wotseedda wode, bare oosuwaan s'illibeennee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:1-14">Dom. 22:1-14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JAS 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 2:22"/>Aa ammanuunne Aa oosuu ittippe ootseeddawaanne Aa ammanuu Aa oosuwaan poletteeddawaa be'ikkii? <verse eid="JAS 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 2:23"/>S'oossaa Mas'aafay «Abraahaamo S'oossaa ammaneedda. S'oossaykka hewaa aw s'illotetsan paydeedda» geeddawe poletteedda; k'ay S'oossaa dabbo geetettiide I s'eesetteedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Dom. 15:6</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 20:7">2 Od. 20:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 41:8">Isa. 41:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JAS 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 2:24"/>Asay ammano s'alalaana gidennaan, oosuwaan s'illiyaawaa hintte be'iita.<verse eid="JAS 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 2:25"/>Hewaadankka k'ay c'aaratta Ra'aaba kiitettowantta mokkaade hara ogiyaanna unttuntta moyzzeedda wode, bare oosuwaan s'illabeykkee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 2:1-21">Iya. 2:1-21</ref></char></note><verse eid="JAS 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 2:26"/>Ayaw gooppe, shemppuu shaaketteedda bollay hayk'k'eeddawaa gidiyaawaadan, hewaadankka k'ay oosuu shaaketteedda ammanuu hayk'k'eeddawaa.<verse eid="JAS 2:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JAS 3"/>
  <para style="s">Ins's'arssaa Naagiyaawaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 3:1"/>Taanaadan S'oossaa kaalliyaawanttoo, nuuni haratuwaappe aad'd'iyaa pirddaa akkanawaa hintte eriyaa diraw, hintteppe c'oratuu tamaarissiyaawantta gidoppite. <verse eid="JAS 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 3:2"/>Nuuni ubbaykka daroban baleetto; itti uray bare haasayan mulekka balana d'ayooppe, I barena naaganaw danddayiyaa bali bayinna asaa. <verse eid="JAS 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 3:3"/>Paratuu nuw azazettana mala, bis'aalaa barssiide, nuuni koyyiyaasaa ubbaa unttuntta afeetto. <verse eid="JAS 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 3:4"/>Be'ite, markkabatuukka k'ay hewaa keenaa wolk'k'aama gidiidde, gotuwaa c'arkkuwaan laagettoopekka, unttuntta laaggiyaawe barewaa koyyiyaasaa zaariide laaggiyaa k'eeri guutsaa mitsaan laagettiide biino. <verse eid="JAS 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 3:5"/>Hewaadan ins's'arssay bollaa giddon guutsa asatetsaa gidooppekka, daro wolk'k'aamaban c'eek'ettee.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JAS 3:5">Guutsa tamay waaniide wolk'k'aama wora guuddii! Akeekite. <verse eid="JAS 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 3:6"/>Ins's'arssaykka tamaa mala. I nu asatetsaa giddon iitabaa ubbaa ootsana danddayee; asatetsaa ubbaa tunissee. K'ay nu de'uwaa wotsaakka tamaan guuddee; Gaannamiyaa tamaan I guudettanawaa. <verse eid="JAS 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 3:7"/>Ayaw gooppe, do'atuwaa, kafatuwaa zariyaa, tiraan gooshettiyaa shooshshatuu zariyaanne abbaan de'iyaa med'etatuwaa zariyaa ubbaa Asay aadisseedda; k'ay unttunttukka aadeeddino. <verse eid="JAS 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 3:8"/>Shin ooninne ins's'arssaa aadissanaw danddayibeenna; ins's'arssay wod'iyaa marzzii kumeedda c'o"u geena iita med'etaa. <verse eid="JAS 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 3:9"/>Nuuni ins's'arssan nu Godaanne Aawuwaa galateetto; k'ay aanikka S'oossaa malatiide med'etteedda asaa shek'k'eetto.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:26">Dom. 1:26</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JAS 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 3:10"/>Itti doonaappe galataynne shek'ay kesee. Taanaadan S'oossaa kaalliyaawanttoo, hewe hewaadan hananaw bessena. <verse eid="JAS 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 3:11"/>Pulttuu itti ollaappe mal"iyaa haatsaanne c'ammiyaa haatsaa pulttanaw danddayii? <verse eid="JAS 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 3:12"/>Taanaadan S'oossaa kaalliyaawanttoo, balasiyaa giyaa mitsay wogaraa ayifanaw danddayii? Woy woyniyaa turay balasiyaa giyaa mitsaa ayifanaw danddayii? Mas'ine mas'ine giyaa haatsaappekka mal"o haatsay kesana danddayenna.<verse eid="JAS 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Saluwaa Aad'd'eedda Eraanne <optbreak/>Sa'aa Aad'd'eedda Eraa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 3:13"/>Hintte giddon aad'd'eedda eranchchaynne akeekanchchay oonee? Bare lo"o de'uwaan oosetteedda bare oosuwaa aad'd'eedda eratetsaappe yiyaa ashikketetsaan besso. <verse eid="JAS 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 3:14"/>Shin hintte wozanaan c'ammiyaa k'anaatiinne yirggii de'oppo. K'ay tumatetsaa bollaakka worddotoppitenne otorettoppite. <verse eid="JAS 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 3:15"/>Hewaa mala aad'd'eedda eratetsay saluwaappe wod'd'iyaawaa gidenna; shin hewe sa'aabaa, asaawaa, s'alahatuwaa. <verse eid="JAS 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 3:16"/>Ayaw gooppe, k'anaatiinne yirggii de'iyaa saan walassaynne iita ooso ubbay de'ee. <verse eid="JAS 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 3:17"/>Shin bollappe yiyaa aad'd'eedda eratetsay ubbaappe kase geeshsha. K'ay sarotetsaa dosiyaawaa, ashikkenne eeno giyaawaa; k'ay maarotetsaynne lo"o ayfii kumeeddawaa. Sid'iinne lo"o malatiyaa iitatetsay bayinnawaa. <verse eid="JAS 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 3:18"/>S'illotetsaa ayfii sarotetsaa ootsiyaawanttu sarotetsaan zereedda zeretsaappe beetteedda.<verse eid="JAS 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JAS 4"/>
  <para style="s">Ha Alamiyaa Iitatetsaa Dosennan Agganawaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 4:1"/>Olaynne walassay hintte gidduwaa hak'appe yii? Unttunttu yeeddasay hintte bollaa giddon olettiyaa hintte nashettanaw wolk'k'aama amuwaa amottiyaawaappe gidennee? <verse eid="JAS 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 4:2"/>Hintte amottiita; shin demmikkita; wod'iita. Loytsi koyyiita; shin demmanaw danddaykkita; walak'ettiitanne olettiita. Shin S'oossaa woossenna diraw, hintte koyiyaawaa demmikkita. <verse eid="JAS 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 4:3"/>S'oossaa woossiita, shin demmikkita; gaasuukka balaa ogiyaan woossiita. Hewaa hinttena nashechchiyaawaan peeshshanaw koyyiyaa diraassa. <verse eid="JAS 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 4:4"/>Simmi woshummiyaawanttoo, ha alamiyaanna dabbotiyaawe S'oossaw morkke gidiyaawaa erikkitee? Ayaw gooppe, ha alamiyaanna dabbotanaw koyyiyaawe ooninne S'oossaanna morkkettee. <verse eid="JAS 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 4:5"/>Woy S'oossaa Mas'aafay, «S'oossay nuunan wotseedda Ayyaanay wolk'k'aama amuwaa nuw amottee» giyaawaa hinttenttoo c'oo giyaawaa malatii? <verse eid="JAS 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 4:6"/>Shin S'oossay aad'd'o keekatetsaa aatsiide immee. Hewaa diraw, S'oossaa Mas'aafay, «S'oossay otorettiyaawantta is's'ee; shin barena kawushshiyaawanttoo aad'd'o keekatetsaa immee» yaagee.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:34">Lem. 3:34</ref></char></note><verse eid="JAS 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 4:7"/>Simmi, hintte S'oossaw moodettite. Yaatiide s'alahiyaanna ek'ettite; I hintteppe bak'atana. <verse eid="JAS 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 4:8"/>S'oossaakko shiik'ite; ikka hinttekko shiik'ana. Hinttenoo nagaranchchatoo, hintte kushiyaa meec'ettite. Laa"u k'ofay de'iyaawanttoo, hintte wozanaa geeshshite. <verse eid="JAS 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 4:9"/>Tuggattite; kayyottitenne yeekkite. Hintte miichchaa yeekoo laammite; hintte nashechchaakka kayyoo laammite. <verse eid="JAS 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 4:10"/>Godaa sintsan hintte huup'iyaa toochchite; k'ay I hinttena d'ok'k'u d'ok'k'u ootsana.<verse eid="JAS 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Asaa Bolla Pirddennaan Agganawaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 4:11"/>Taanaadan S'oossaa kaalliyaawanttoo, ittuu ittuwaa zigiroppite. Bare ishaa zigiriyaawenne Aa bolla pirddiyaawe higgiyaa zigireenne higgiyaa bolla pirddee. Neeni higgiyaa bolla pirddooppe, higgiyaa bolla pirddiyaawaa gidaasappe attin, higgew azazettiyaawaa gidakka. <verse eid="JAS 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 4:12"/>Higgiyaa immiyaawenne pirddiyaawe S'oossaa s'alalaa; I ashshanawunne d'ayissanaw danddayee; shin ne shooruwaa bolla pirddiyaawe neeni oonee?<verse eid="JAS 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">C'eek'ettennaadan Imetteedda Zoriyaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 4:13"/>Hinttenoo, «Nuuni hachche woy wontti he katamaa baana; hewan laytsaa uttana; zal"ananne k'ay miishshaa wod'isana» giyaawanttoo, be'ite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13-14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 27:1">Lem. 27:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JAS 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 4:14"/>Wontti hintte de'uu ayaa hananenttonne erikkita; guutsa wodew hintte beettiide, guyyeppe d'ayiyaa peenuwaa mala. <verse eid="JAS 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 4:15"/>Hewaa aggiide, «Goday gooppe, nuuni de'ana; hawaa woy hewaa ootsana» gaanaw bessee. <verse eid="JAS 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 4:16"/>Shin hintte ha"i hinttenttu d'ok'k'atetsaan c'eek'ettiita; hewaa mala c'eek'uu ubbay iita.<verse eid="JAS 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 4:17"/>Hewaa diraw, lo"obaa ootsanaw eriidde ootsenna uraw hewe nagaraa.<verse eid="JAS 4:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JAS 5"/>
  <para style="s">Dure Asaassi Imetteedda Mino Zoriyaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 5:1"/>Ha"ikka hinttenoo dure asatoo, hintte bolla yiyaa tuggaw «Aayye! Aayye!» yaagiide yeekkitenne zilaalite. <verse eid="JAS 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 5:2"/>Hintte duretetsay bay diggeedda; k'ay hintte afilaakka bil"ay mi diggeedda. <verse eid="JAS 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 5:3"/>Hintte work'k'aynne hintte biray shi'i diggeedda. K'ay he shi'ay hintte bolla markkattana; hintte bollaakka tamaadan maana. Hintte hintte miishshaa sintsaw dagayi de'iita. <verse eid="JAS 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 5:4"/>Akeekite; hintte gaden katsaa k'oyc'eedda asatoo c'iggibeenna kiraa miishshay waassee; unttunttu waasuu wolk'k'aama Godaa haytsaan sisetteedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 24:14-15">Zar. 24:14-15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JAS 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 5:5"/>Hinttew injjetina, sa'aan ishaliide de'eeddita; shukaa gallassaw d'iikkiyaawaadan, hintte bollaa d'iikkeeddita. <verse eid="JAS 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 5:6"/>S'illo asaa bolla pirddeeddita; k'ay Aa wod'eeddita; I hinttenanna ek'ettenna.<verse eid="JAS 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Godaa laa'entso Yuussaa Danddayan Naagiyaawaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 5:7"/>Hewaa diraw, taanaadan S'oossaa kaalliyaawanttoo, Goday yaana gakkanaw genc'c'ite; biittaa goshiyaawe adilliyaa iraynne assuuraa iray yaana gakkanaw genc'c'iide, al"o katsaa I wooti naagiide gatsi akkintto be'ite. <verse eid="JAS 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 5:8"/>Hinttekka k'ay genc'c'ite; hintte wozanaa minisite. Ayaw gooppe, Godaa yuussay matatteedda.<verse eid="JAS 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 5:9"/>Taanaadan S'oossaa kaalliyaawanttoo, S'oossay hintte bolla pirddenna mala, ittuu ittuwaa bolla zuuzummoppite. Be'ite, pirddiyaawe penggiyaan ek'k'eedda. <verse eid="JAS 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 5:10"/>Taanaadan S'oossaa kaalliyaawanttoo, waayiyaassinne genc'c'aw leemisuwaa gideeddawantta, Godaa suntsan haasayeedda nabatuwaa hassayite. <verse eid="JAS 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 5:11"/>Be'ite, danddayiide genc'c'eeddawantta nuuni anjjetteeddawantta geetto. Iyyooba genc'c'aa hintte siseeddita; k'ay Goday aw wurssetsaan immeeddawaakka beeddita. Ayaw gooppe, Goday maarotaynne k'aretay kumeeddawaa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:21-22">Yob. 1:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 2:10">2:10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 103:8">Maz. 103:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="JAS 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 5:12"/>Shin ubbaappe kase, taanaadan S'oossaa kaalliyaawanttoo, saluwaan gidina, woy sa'aan gidina, woy hara c'aak'uwaan gidina, ayankka c'aak'k'oppite. Shin S'oossaa pirddan hintte gelennaadan, hintte yewuu Ee giyaawaa gidooppe, «Ee» giite; gidenna giyaawaa gidooppe, «Gidenna» giite.<verse eid="JAS 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 5:13"/>Hintte giddon waayettiyaa uray ooninne de'ooppe, S'oossaa woosso; nashettiyaa uray ooninne de'ooppe, yes's'iide galato. <verse eid="JAS 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 5:14"/>Hintteppe sakettiyaa uray ooninne de'ooppe, ammaniyaa asaa kaaletsiyaa c'imatuwaa barekko s'eeso; unttunttu Godaa suntsan zayitiyaa Aa okkiide, aw S'oossaa woossino. <verse eid="JAS 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 5:15"/>Ammanuwaan S'oossaa woosseedda woosay hargganchchaa patsana; Godaykka Aa harggiyaappe dentsana; k'ay nagaraa I ootseeddawaa gidooppekka Goday aw atto gaana. <verse eid="JAS 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 5:16"/>Hewaa diraw, hintte pas'ana mala, hintte nagaraa ittuu ittoo paas'itenne ittuu ittoo S'oossaa woossite; s'illo asaa woosay wolk'k'aama oosuwaa ootsee. <verse eid="JAS 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 5:17"/>Eelaas nu mala asaa. Iray sa'aan bukkennaadan, I minisiide, S'oossaa woossina heezzu laytsanne usuppun agenaa sa'aan iray bukkibeenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:1">1 Kat. 17:1</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 18:1">18:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JAS 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 5:18"/>Laa'entsuwaa S'oossaa I woossina, saluwaappe iray bukkeedda; sa'aykka bare katsaa mokkeedda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:42-45">1 Kat. 18:42-45</ref></char></note><verse eid="JAS 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 5:19"/>Taanaadan S'oossaa kaalliyaawanttoo, hintteppe ooninne tumuwaappe wora booppe, k'ay ittuu Aa guyye he tumuwaakko zaarooppe, <verse eid="JAS 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 5:20"/>nagaranchchaa Aa balaa ogiyaappe zaariyaa ooninne Aa shemppuwaa hayk'uwaappe ashshanawaanne daro nagaraa kammanawaa ero.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 10:12">Lem. 10:12</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 4:8">1 P'es'. 4:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="JAS 5:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 5"/>
</usx>
